    "updated_at": "2017-05-15T13:26:19Z",
    "body": "https://notifications.spec.whatwg.org/#create-a-notification (step 3) defines that a `TypeError` should be thrown when using the `actions` option with the constructor.\r\n\r\nClicking on a non-persistent notification after the page has gone away can right now just open a new tab for the originating page. Imagine such a notification having an \"stop bothering me\" button—it's impossible to handle that appropriately with the existing API surface.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
