    "created_at": "2017-05-16T00:20:42Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-05-16T00:20:42Z",
    "body": "Seems weird to expose them on the Notification object if they can't be used. Perhaps Notification needs to be split into separate classes for persistent and non-persistent variants if their behavior is going to be different? ",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
